    "testImpact": "Existing frozen native integer-table hash serializes old variable prices. Preserve semantic/canonical comparison via combined-minus-fixed at stored levels, rather than blindly changing expected digest. Keep freshness/disposal/refresh-at-full-root/no-allocation, bounds and actual residual/packet oracles.",
    "analyticBounds": {
      "conservativeBinaryCost": 2048,
      "variableTreeBitsIncludingOptionalEob": 7,
      "fixedSignPlusCategoryBound": 22784,
      "combinedUshortBound": 37120,
      "proof": "Inclusive arithmetic normalization shifts are0..7;2048is conservative above7*256. Variable branch depth<=6plus optional EOB1; fixed sign256plus at most11category bits. Sum fits UInt16. This is an owned-source bound, not a reference-encoder CPU claim."
    },
    "proposedTransformation": "Stored variable0..67becomes fixed+variable in the SAMEexisting96x68ushortcapacity. For actual>67, add signedFixed[actual]-Fixed[67]; preserve exact integer rate and multiplication order. Rename internal variable-only view to describe combined prices and update every consumer; no wrapper/buffer for unpublished layout compatibility.",
    "risks": "Extra refresh work and common/rare branching may outweigh removed loads. Measure full operation preparation, native packet parity, CPU and allocations using existing photo/effort6diagram controls. Same root/capacity/lifetime; no new cache/pool/session or retry. No production edit or timing claim yet.",
    "baseline": {
      "windows": "7c402328867de6b24c0efa7595db387cde40f24175bcd36b36036543039457e3",
      "linux": "ad2abb3fb3600400553989bc09df141caf02b98d713d151af38f8e0fca83b9f6"
    },
    "boundedStage": "Fuse fixed and variable prices in existing owned words; preserve canonical native table hash by semantic serialization, update all three consumers without compatibility storage. Complete photograph/trellis short, independent confirmation only when promising. Same immutable build perOS; no full/package until acceptance.",
    "syntheticTestAdjustment": "Initial focused W/L64pass/1fail: synthetic random UInt16 variable+fixed sum is not representable in UInt16, outside generated37120bound. Preserve failed logs. Mask synthetic prices to14bits, independently compute original scalar semantics in Python and C# oracle, freeze digest; actual native table/residual/trellis/packet digests unchanged. Only embedded tests rebuild; immutable production candidate reused."
  },
